# Python bytecode -- regenerated on every run
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Claude Code session history (recall plugin)
.recall/

# NOTE: projects/ is deliberately NOT ignored. A curated subset of the run
# outputs is to be committed and tagged for the preprint; see the reorganisation
# step before adding anything, so that 16 GB of checkpoints does not go in by
# accident. Until then it simply shows as untracked.
